<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Coles mulling property sale options.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Coles mulling property sale options.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coles Myer Ltd chief executive Peter Bartels said on Tuesday the company hopes to complete its property disposal programme within this financial year.</p>
<p>He said options being considered, on advice from SBC Warburg, included trade sale or floats.  </p>
<p>Coles Myer announced earlier on Tuesday that property sales during 1995/96 totalled A$134.4 million, reducing property rental and management income, with some offsetting reductions in interest costs.</p>
<p>It said a review of the future of the company's A$1.4 billion proerty portfolio was continuing and an announcement was expected before the end of calendar 1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
